cff-version: "1.2.0"
message: If you use this app, please cite it and the works it builds on, listed under references.
type: software
title: Clinical Brain MRI Volumetrics
abstract: 'An end-to-end neuroimaging workflow built from Pennsieve apps: it skull-strips, bias-corrects,
  registers and segments T1-weighted brain MRI (with white-matter hyperintensity segmentation when a FLAIR
  is present) and writes a volumetric report per subject.'
authors:
- name: Pennsieve (University of Pennsylvania)
repository-code: https://github.com/pennsieve-apps/workflow-clinical-brain-mri
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
- neuroimaging
- mri
- nifti
- segmentation
- volumetrics
- workflow
